Z||000000||mbramble||03-02-2001||09:24 AM||||Would just like to report another great helping hand provided by a PFF member.<P>I posted on the Mall that I needed a couple of replacement lenses after I had a wreck last week.  A member, turbo86se, put the things in the mail to me immediately just for the cost of postage.  And he did it without waiting for the money --- which I have gladly sent.<P>It's great to know that you can still get help like this and I for one appreciate it, and Cliff for the Forum where things like this can happen.<P>Thanks,<BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
